<title>USA: Canmax, EDS terminate pacts.</title>
<headline>Canmax, EDS terminate pacts.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canmax Inc and EDS Corp said Friday they had terminated their formal joint marketing and other supporting business agreements.</p>
<p>However, they said they would continue to work together on an ad hoc basis.</p>
<p>The formal termination of the agreements was effective April 29, they said.</p>
</text>
